      "evidence": "line 14:displayBenefits 直接调用 getAllNonAdminUsers 并渲染全部用户列表，未检查当前用户是否为管理员 → 任何登录用户均可查看所有非管理员用户",
      "unanimous": true
    },
    {
      "file": "app/routes/contributions.js",
      "feature": "llm_only:CWE-95 Improper Neutralization of Directives in Dynamically Evaluated Code",
      "evidence": "line 33:使用 eval() 直接解析 req.body.preTax、req.body.afterTax、req.body.roth → 攻击者可构造恶意表达式（如 process.exit()、require('child_process').execSync('...')）→ 任意代码执行 → 未授权操作",
      "unanimous": true
    },
    {
